    {
      "key": "pages.info.venuesportstab.df9e299b2c47",
      "source": "根据清华大学体育部场馆中心 2025 年 12 月 3 日发布的公告 七、12、如有用户通过脚本软件或插件等非正常途径预定场地，一经发现并核实，对该用户封禁预订权限 6 个月，并函告相关院系或单位。OneTHU 仅提供场馆情况查询，请点击按钮前往官网预约；如果不当使用源码进行预约，违反本项目开源准则，后果自负。",
      "kind": "text",
      "parameters": [],
      "locations": [
        {
          "file": "apps/desktop/src/pages/info/VenueSportsTab.tsx",
          "line": 834,
          "context": "{i18n(\"pages.info.venuesportstab.df9e299b2c47\")}"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "According to announcement 7.12 published by the Tsinghua University Sports Department Venue Center on December 3, 2025: users who book fields through scripts, plugins, or other improper channels will, once confirmed, have their booking privileges banned for 6 months, and the relevant department or unit will be notified. OneTHU only provides venue availability lookup; please tap the button to book on the official website. Misusing the source code for reservations violates this project's open-source principles, and you bear the consequences.",
      "status": "prefilled-review",
      "limitHint": "Preserve meaning; do not truncate."
    },
